direction_600 = location "Goblin Bouncer" about "Goblin Bouncer\nGoblins live in groups and are classified as Kobolt, Bug Bear and Goblin Bouncer in descending strength. " found "Karus Goblin Village" at 321 113 in zone 1

On available
    Say "Now, we have come to our final subjugation mission!\n[Goblin Bouncers] dwell only in the deep underground or where there is only darkness. But it is clear that they are sensing the danger of our subjugation!"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "You are here. The [Goblin Bouncers], our enemy's main troop, are finally  exposed. If we subjugate them, they won't dare to act for some time."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Of Goblin Karus area near the town of [the Raul Goblin Squad] and goblins need to fight against the bouncer."

On in_progress
    Say "More! More! It is still not enough!"

On claimable
    Show quest "They always gave us trouble because they only attacked from behind.  But we have finally wiped them out completely.  All thanks to you, <selfname>. Now, come on and let's get going.\n\nYou have done well! You live up to your reputation. May the glory of God be with you, <selfname>."
